<title>UK: Nomura sets calls on Manchester United Plc.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets calls on Manchester United Plc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it has issued American-style call warrants, on Manchester United Plc.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6.40 STG		  ISSUE	  2.02 STG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.DEC.98		 SPOT REF     6.89 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
